+ * Envelope markers a log-only event may declare at {@link Session.append}.
+ *
+ * `ignorable` lets a reader that does not know the event type skip it instead of refusing the
+ * whole log. Only a producer whose record cannot affect reconstruction may set it, so it is
+ * opt-in per append rather than a property of the event type.
+ */
